<% content_for :title, "Privacy Policy · Nalu" %>

<article class="legal-page">
  <%= render("trip_templates/page_profile_bar", left: capture do %>
    <h1 class="page-profile-bar__title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <%= web_back_link %>
  <% end) %>

  <div class="legal-page__section">
    <p>
    <br>
      <strong>Last updated:</strong> 2026-03-20
    </p>

  </div>

  <section class="legal-page__section">
    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We may collect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Your account name and email address (if you create an account)</li>
      <li><strong>User Preferences:</strong> such as travel interests, saved destinations, and customization settings you provide</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-page__section">
    <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
    <p>We use your data to:</p>
    <ul>
    <li>Provide personalized travel recommendations</li>
    <li>Customize your experience within the App</li>
    <li>Maintain and improve the App’s functionality</li>
    <li>Respond to support requests (if you contact us)</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-page__section">
    <h2>AI Processing</h2>
    <p>
      Information you provide (e.g., travel preferences, destinations) may be processed by AI systems to generate responses. Data may be used in anonymized form to improve the App.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-page__section">
    <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell your personal data. We may share information with:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Service providers (e.g., hosting, analytics)</li>
      <li>Legal authorities when required by law</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-page__section">
    <h2>Data Security</h2>
    <p>
      We take reasonable measures to protect your information. However, no system is completely secure.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-page__section">
    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    
    <p>You may have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Access your data</li>
      <li>Request correction or deletion</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      To exercise these rights, contact: phoebezhu1611@gmail.com
    </p>
  </section>


  <section class="legal-page__section">
    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      This Privacy Policy may be updated. Continued use of the App indicates acceptance of any changes.
    </p>
  </section>
</article>
